# 🔌 GridSense — Electricity Anomaly Detection

Detects electricity theft, equipment faults and power 
surges from smart meter data using Machine Learning.

## 🧠 Models Used
- Simple Linear Regression
- Multiple Linear Regression
- Decision Tree
- SVM (Support Vector Machine)
- Random Forest

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
Python, scikit-learn, pandas, matplotlib, streamlit

## ▶️ How to Run

### Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

### Run dashboard
streamlit run dashboard.py

## 📊 Dataset
UCI Individual Household Electric Power Consumption
https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/235/individual+household+electric+power+consumption

## 📁 Project Structure
GridSense/
├── dashboard.py        ← Streamlit web app
├── gridsense.ipynb     ← Jupyter notebook (all models)
├── requirements.txt    ← dependencies
└── README.md           ← project description